    <string name="settings_live_player_header">Live TV engine</string>
    <string name="settings_player_scope_desc">Auto starts Live TV with ExoPlayer hardware and uses a channel-specific safe fallback after a confirmed codec, green-frame or frozen-video failure. Movies, series and catch-up use Media3 for modern formats and automatically switch to VLC for legacy containers or verified decoder, audio, subtitle and output incompatibilities. Player and decoder choices remain preferences, so content never stays trapped on a broken path.</string>
