    <string name="settings_player_vlc_desc">Prefer VLC; recover between safe hardware and quality software decode</string>
    <string name="settings_exo_requires_hardware">ExoPlayer uses the device MediaCodec path and cannot start in VLC software decoding. Decoder will be changed to Hardware preferred; verified incompatibility can still recover safely.</string>
